--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/live-game.md
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+# Live game implementation
+
+- A `Game` belongs to a quiz and snapshots its active question IDs when it starts.
+- Game states are `lobby`, `open`, `closed`, and `ended`.
+- Players are identified by a signed browser cookie plus a unique player token in SQLite.
+- Answers are unique per game/player/question, so submitting again updates the last choice.
+- Moderator and player pages poll small JSON state endpoints every 1.5 seconds; they do not require page reloads.
+- The player state endpoint never includes answer correctness while the question is open.
